  message: "Fixed in PR #3513 (commit f919fb9ba). Added is_example_file and is_config_file boolean fields to Symbol mirroring the WI-rigun is_test_file pattern. Set in supply_chain.classify_file via FileClassification (is_example fires on EXAMPLE_PATTERNS match; is_config fires on CONFIG_FILE_NAMES basename match, suppressed when is_test or is_example already True to preserve mutual exclusion). Wired through both call sites (cli.py _classify_symbols and sketch.py). Round-trips through Symbol.to_dict / from_dict via supply_chain sub-object. Property test confirms within tier 2 the three role flags are mutually exclusive. Pre-existing per-package isolation gap on mainstream py.py:1724 also closed in the same PR by adding a _detect_source_roots test for the skip-dir branch."  # b4dc
